{"book":"psalmi","chapter":99,"verses":[{"v":1,"pairs":[["Psalmus in confessione.","A Psalm of Confession."]]},{"v":2,"pairs":[["Jubilate Deo,","Shout joyfully to God,"],["omnis terra;","all the earth."],["servite Domino in lætitia.","Serve the Lord with rejoicing."],["Introite in conspectu ejus in exsultatione.","Enter into his sight in exultation."]]},{"v":3,"pairs":[["Scitote quoniam Dominus ipse est Deus;","Know that the Lord himself is God."],["ipse fecit nos,","He made us,"],["et non ipsi nos:","and we ourselves did not."],["populus ejus,","We are his people"],["et oves pascuæ ejus.","and the sheep of his pasture."]]},{"v":4,"pairs":[["Introite portas ejus in confessione;","Enter his gates with confession,"],["atria ejus in hymnis:","his courts with hymns,"],["confitemini illi.","and acknowledge him."],["Laudate nomen ejus,","Praise his name."]]},{"v":5,"pairs":[["quoniam suavis est Dominus,","For the Lord is sweet,"],["in æternum misericordia ejus,","his mercy is in eternity,"],["et usque in generationem et generationem veritas ejus.","and his truth is from generation to generation."]]}]}